# The PM8150B charger exposes its own coarse state-of-charge estimate as a
# second battery. Now that the BQ27411 fuel gauge is described, that estimate
# is redundant and shows up as a duplicate indicator that disagrees with the
# gauge by a percent or two. Keep the gauge, hide the charger's estimate.
SUBSYSTEM=="power_supply", KERNEL=="qcom-battery", ENV{UPOWER_IGNORE}="1"
